==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Greninja|41}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion, as was its '''Mist Slash''' attack.
**Both cards also have the Water Shuriken {{TCG|Ability}}; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Greninja}} can learn.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Greninja|162}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Greninja}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

